{"pull": {"id": "number:18789", "number": 18789, "title": "KAFKA-18379: Enforce resigned cannot transition to any other state in same epoch", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-02-03T14:46:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-03-17T03:26:50Z", "merged_at": null, "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "JIRA: KAFKA-18379\r\nFor further details, please refer to [KIP-996](https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=272927537#KIP996:PreVote-ResignedStatechanges) and https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/18240#discussion_r1899341945.\r\n\r\nIn short, this PR adds a check for the transition from the resigned state to other states to prevent a resigned leader from accidentally becoming its own follower in the same epoch, which would create an invalid circular reference.\r\n\r\n### Committer Checklist (excluded from commit message)\r\n- [ ] Verify design and implementation \r\n- [ ] Verify test coverage and CI build status\r\n- [ ] Verify documentation (including upgrade notes)\r\n", "labels":